relative and normal zindex for slide over.
slide under - almost works in stash.

if reveal-enter-top - add class reveal enter top
if reveal-exit-top or reveal-exit - must add additional vh.

for pan and zoom
add vh * steps
and check how much scrolled. trigger each step animation and then text.

reveal-enter-top - the slide will scroll over the previous one.
reveal-exit-top - the next slide will scroll over this one.
reveal-exit - the next slide will be revealed from underneath this one.
reveal-enter - this slide will be revealed from underneath the previous one.

